    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "This property specifies the current red, green, and blue gain values used for white balance.",
      "ko": "이 속성은 화이트 밸런스에 사용되는 현재 빨간색, 녹색, 파란색 게인 값을 지정합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "659b57652556268e281e94047767e5a3f3df3430df44a0db71e3dde2e64e0592",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "You can use the values to adjust color casts for a given scene.",
      "ko": "If you require specifying capture settings not covered by a capture session preset, you can set the [`activeFormat`](avcapturedevice/activeformat.md) property to any of the formats in this array.",
      "sourceHash": "b97f80ca5db9146afd47ceb7a667df71b0a130ea6cc8cdd47538c1fdf4366e1e",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0003",
      "source": "Each channel supports values between 1.0 and -[`maxWhiteBalanceGain`](avcapturedevice/maxwhitebalancegain.md).",
      "ko": "각 채널은 1.0에서 [`maxWhiteBalanceGain`](avcapturedevice/maxwhitebalancegain.md) 사이의 값을 지원합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "006c082625901f69fbf6520395242af32f9e580bd53ce6eede7001533832a2fc",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "This property is key-value observable.",
      "ko": "이 속성은 key-value 관찰이 가능합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "da10f6fb15a1291aedea3de21f0a99a0321c2e86790d0f3fd44477cca7d3c9a7",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
